WEBVTT

00:03:28.485 --> 00:03:31.555
241 km/h kroz Bonvil Solt Flets,

00:03:31.555 --> 00:03:36.026
vozio u Tanderhil trkačkom parku
po lepom vremenu,

00:03:36.026 --> 00:03:38.665
po vetru i kiši,

00:03:38.665 --> 00:03:43.683
i uspešno je prošao
sve 153 krivine na 20km

00:03:43.683 --> 00:03:45.245
dugačkom usponu 
Pajks Pik Hil puta

00:03:45.245 --> 00:03:48.718
u Koloradu bez ikoga za volanom.

00:03:48.718 --> 00:03:50.166
(Smeh)

00:03:50.166 --> 00:03:55.732
(Aplauz)

00:03:55.732 --> 00:03:59.011
Mislim da nema potrebe 
da vam kažem da smo se super

00:03:59.011 --> 00:04:00.315
zabavili radeći na ovom projektu.